# Dual-Sun Adepts: double strike, and "{5}: Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn" (CR 611.2c, 613.4c). On turn three Bot1
# holds only four mana, so the ability is refused (the cost is five, not four); with Black Lotus's three it pays and leaves two
# behind (five, not four or six). The Adepts (2/2) becomes 3/3 and Bot1's Memnite 2/2, Bot2's Ornithopter stays 0/2 (Bot1's creatures
# only), and on Bot2's turn the Adepts and the Memnite are back to 2/2 and 1/1.

